{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff7f65538ca519c341bded6dc1b65dc527a6e2a08e62fa81d7c9fad4a815b89e", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ企画。\n可奈の撮影は順調に進み、休憩に入った）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣企划。可奈的拍摄进展顺利，已经进入休息时间）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "4cf1ce3834243cf7444b813c278546352c36e44f38984137f798419a6156400f", "ja": "{$P$}さぁんっ！\n助けてください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n请帮帮我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e6d42f9a00e9483154136748d7c3d14f70f25a0b6cee7adf64843509315c8e68", "ja": "どうしたんだ……！？", "zh": "怎么了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "a44d4189ffaa86ac69e70b87bb6d7c623cccae7e765bdbd3898e21e1eebcbbc7", "ja": "それが……「この後の撮影は、いつもどおりの\n可奈ちゃんで」って監督さんに言われたんです……！", "zh": "是这样……导演说“接下来的拍摄，就按平时的可奈来”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8067e2f4045b20177fc9b239b852487a16430b928168ee749efaf862d208d7d6", "ja": "監督さんが？\nちなみにさっきは、どんな感じだったんだ？", "zh": "导演说的？\n顺便问一下，刚才是什么感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "5380fe690718c1e4d2200ba0c487c29dc4d6e1e7cc7695911620e67f1faf1f2a", "ja": "クールな感じです！　このパジャマ、大人っぽいじゃ\nないですか。だから、お姉さんっぽくしてみたんです。", "zh": "是很酷的感觉！这套睡衣不是很有成熟气质嘛。所以，我就试着表现得像个大姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1006_p", "source_sha256": "040372356b51061d7e6d4869027988315aa1a7ccec3eea5cd43216dfa26e040f", "ja": "なるほど……。質問なんだけど、\nいつも、寝る前はどんな風に過ごしてるんだ？", "zh": "原来如此……我想问一下，你平时睡前都会怎么度过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "e01f092526dfcd337a1423784bc17531a2c505e992c6da37be5e255eb8723706", "ja": "いつもですか？　友達とおしゃべりしたり、寝る前\nだからお菓子我慢しなきゃ～、ってなったり……。", "zh": "平时吗？会和朋友聊聊天，或者觉得快\n睡觉了得忍住不能吃零食～之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "5a472b3bf20714a738fa6e0eccbfd0ca5d2236c58a4f7d3c3e6277f3c5b2a5ef", "ja": "あとは……やっぱり歌っちゃいます！　夜だから\n小さい声でですけど。えへ……♪", "zh": "还有……果然还是会唱歌！虽然因为是晚上，只能小声唱。嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "b63e67932fdd73c36fe6b8c4414132b13ec08022482ecdbba268525ea68fec31", "ja": "けるちゃんが一緒に歌ってくれることもあるんですよ。\nけるちゃんとデュエット～♪　デュワワワ～♪", "zh": "ける也会陪我一起唱呢。和ける来个二重唱～♪嘟哇哇哇～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bc4d88c13a77052d3a2efbfcafadaaeee55bfd245b38bd1bf94c94631d78fe1f", "ja": "それだ！\n監督さんが見たいのは、飾らないいつもの可奈の姿だ。", "zh": "就是这个！\n导演先生想看的，是不加修饰、平时的可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "5693c2ff8d2b085b15a553cbcc34b656d59d38e5e660c7c656c924615b9df8d3", "ja": "ええっ！？　でもそれじゃあ、\n大人なパジャマに合わないですよ……！", "zh": "诶！？可是那样的话，就和成熟风的睡衣不搭了呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cf4a288d7a7816ed6a66bda353bdc70553250b219b3e9aee327e4b07bc157e41", "ja": "そんなことない。可奈は大人になっても\n歌でみんなを笑顔にしてると思うんだ。", "zh": "没这回事。我觉得可奈就算长大了，也一定会用歌声让大家露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1013_p", "source_sha256": "118ddf174901c0eb5011c8e9af2f844ffbec5c20f14b61a5dac4dcbaf993a4a4", "ja": "監督さんも、大人になっても変わらない部分……\n可奈らしい姿を撮りたかったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想导演也希望拍下可奈即使长大成人后依然不变的那一面……可奈独有的模样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "3978d7db363d87f394d2e776c8883f03090e90359e018d96ce2c4081875879db", "ja": "そっか……えへへ。大人なパジャマを着ても、\n笑顔で歌っててもいいですよね！", "zh": "这样啊……嘿嘿。就算穿着成熟风的睡衣，\n笑着唱歌也没问题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bf468f8900f9d12e848b0f34809d8f13a291b05ac637e13a5d5f72ec065440db", "ja": "ああ。この後の撮影は、\nちょっぴり大人になった、笑顔の可奈を見せてくれ。", "zh": "啊。接下来的拍摄，就让我看看稍微成熟了一点、面带笑容的可奈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0503_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "f3317fbcdea7043b39920a9640d61e1a6c8e265a2d84a2424f98f612eadf7816", "ja": "はい！　未来の可奈は、余裕たっぷり～♪\n今はまだまだ猪突猛進～♪　今日も全力で頑張るぞ～♪", "zh": "好！未来的可奈，会展现出从容满满的一面～♪\n现在还在一股脑往前冲～♪今天也要全力加油～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
